| ****Principle 2: Communal Intercession for Leaders Is a Virtue****                     | The community prays for the king, blessing him and interceding for his success. This reflects a moral obligation to support and pray for those in authority.                                                             |
| ****Principle 3: Victory Comes from the Moral Order, Not from Human Strength Alone**** | The moral order is the source of deliverance and success. Those who trust in it will rise and stand upright, while those who trust in mere human power will collapse and fall.                                           |

